sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as Program.Main()
    participant App as ScreenReaderApplication
    participant DI as Autofac Container
    participant DEM as DesktopEventManager
    participant UIA as UiaEventService
    participant PWM as ProgramWindowManager
    participant UI as WinForms UI

    Main->>Main: SetupGlobalExceptionHandlers()
    Main->>App: new ScreenReaderApplication()
    App->>DI: RegisterCoreDependencies()
    DI->>DI: Register Core Services (Singletons)
    DI->>DI: Register UIA Services
    DI->>DI: Register Reader Factory
    App->>DI: Build Container
    DI->>DEM: Auto-activate DesktopEventManager
    DEM->>DEM: Start WinEvent Hook
    DEM->>DEM: Start Message Loop (STA Thread)
    DI->>UIA: Auto-activate UiaEventService
    UIA->>UIA: SetupFocusChangeHandler()
    DI->>PWM: Auto-activate ProgramWindowManager
    PWM->>DEM: Subscribe to FocusedProgramChangedEvent
    App->>UI: Show Main Window
    UI->>UI: Display Tray Icon
